WEBVTT

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:18.410
Once, in times when humans
and demons mingled and coexisted...

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:25.910
...humans led happy lives full of laughter

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.290
under the long-standing rule
of the United Nation of Goodereste.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.330
Wait for me!

00:00:34.370 --> 00:00:35.580
However...

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.040
--Demons!
--Run!

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:46.540
...the demon king, seeking to destabilize
the nation, appeared from the abyss

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:46.540
Twilight the Demon King

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:49.790
and proclaimed to the humans,

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.330
I have captured your princess!

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:58.120
If you wish her returned,
surrender all rule of your lands to the demons.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.030
Princess!

00:00:59.100 --> 00:00:59.740
Princess?!

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:04.620
His words caused great anger
and suffering throughout the nation

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.660
on behalf of the princess.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.660
Oh, Princess Syalis!

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.290
I pray for your safety!

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:13.790
At that moment, a young man cried out.

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.040
Citizens! Raise your heads!

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.790
I will rescue the princess
from the Demon Castle without fail!

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:25.950
Dawner the Hero

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:27.450
Hero!

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:30.040
But the demon king's forces are mighty!

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.620
You will face countless
hardships on your journey!

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:36.080
No, they're of little significance!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:42.540
Indeed... they're nothing compared
to the suffering of Princess Syalis,

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:46.830
who's been abducted to the distant
Demon Realm at the ends of the earth!

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:49.960
Nation of Goodereste

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:54.700
All accepted the hero's words
and worried deeply for the princess.

00:01:55.830 --> 00:01:59.490
At that moment, the abducted princess was...

00:01:58.050 --> 00:01:59.490
Demon Realm

00:02:01.490 --> 00:02:04.930
Demon
Castle

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:10.160
...confined and anguishing behind the sturdy
walls of her Demon Castle prison.

00:02:16.240 --> 00:02:22.240
Princess Syalis

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:19.950
There's nothing to do other than sleep.

00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:26.120
Well, it stands to reason.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:31.160
Though I'm a hostage, they do me no harm.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:34.580
Neither do I have the duties of my country.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:38.290
I get three rather tasty meals a day.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.410
But...

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:43.430
"Killer Clown"

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:43.430
"Two-Headed Dragon"

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:43.430
"Flame Guillotine"

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.950
Oh, the princess!

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.740
...I simply can't get a good night's rest!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:49.240
So I'm sleepy no matter how much I sleep.

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:51.950
I can't recover from
the fatigue of daily life here.

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:55.040
I could fall asleep in about
ten seconds back home.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.490
Could it be the pillow?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:06.410
Is it because of this cheap pillow?

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:10.740
It's kind of scratchy and stiff.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:14.160
That's it! If only I had better bedding!

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:17.800
"Quest"
"Luxury Pillow"

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:21.120
But what to use for cloth and stuffing?

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.950
"Teddy Demons"

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.700
They will work just fine.

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:56.450
It's for my sleep. Forgive me.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.580
No, I suppose this is more efficient.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.370
S-So fluffy.

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.410
Good.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.160
I see.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:33.120
The key, in exchange for more brushing.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.370
Hey, it's the princess!

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:47.370
The human princess is walking about!

00:04:47.370 --> 00:04:48.740
Say what?!

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:25.950
"First Night"
"Sleepless Princess of the Castle"

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.700
Aw, come on. She's actually gone.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.950
Where'd the princess go?

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:34.240
"Quilladillo"

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.200
What's the guard up t--yeowch!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.330
Sh-She went that way!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:46.700
Where is she?!

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:49.130
"Item Storage"

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.830
Where'd she go?!

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:49.490
Find her! Find her!

00:06:49.490 --> 00:06:52.490
Hm? What's all the commotion?

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:56.330
Bad news!
The abducted princess is at death's door!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.160
What?!

00:06:57.160 --> 00:07:02.160
She needs vividly colorful Red Herbs,
Yellow Herbs, and Green Herbs!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:04.240
They're in that chest! Take them!

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.490
Huh?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:13.870
I've obtained materials
for a good night's sleep!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:23.540
First, spin the fur to make yarn.

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:28.660
Then, sew herb-dyed curtains
together with this needle

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.910
and fill it with fluffy stuffing.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.540
I present the deluxe princess sleep pillow!

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:42.740
"Quest Complete"

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.740
"Well done!"

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:42.740
Well done!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:49.540
The sound it makes is completely different.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:53.660
My built-up fatigue is hitting me...

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:00.870
Is it true that the princess escaped for a time?

00:07:57.580 --> 00:08:00.870
"Demon King"

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.120
It is true, Demon King.
The whole castle was in a panic.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:12.200
The princess laments,
despairs, and awaits rescue

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:16.200
in my demon's lair of a castle, does she not?

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.200
I must talk to her!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.790
You're really doing it?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.790
Make that tomorrow?

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.160
Zzz...

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:56.490
Be sure to reclaim the key!

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:01.640
"Teddy Demon"
"Fluffiness: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"
"Willpower: ☆☆"
"Lesser demon."

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.790
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:05.660
The Nation of Goodereste has been in mourning

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.490
since the capture of their
princess by the demon king.

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:12.870
Another day has dawned.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:13.950
Elder...

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.540
Any word from the hero?

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.870
Nothing yet.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:22.790
Today is the fifth day. Is Princess Syalis safe?

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:27.080
I merely hope that no
injuries mar her fair skin.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:34.870
The best sleep I've had in a while.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:39.200
I have sheet marks on my face!

00:09:41.290 --> 00:09:45.910
I let my guard down after
acquiring an agreeable pillow.

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:49.240
This Demon Castle's sheets are cheap, too?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:52.820
"Way off the pillow"

00:09:49.240 --> 00:09:53.120
Plus, my sleeping posture is not the best.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:56.200
And my crown marked on my forehead.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:59.870
Why do I even sleep with it on?

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:05.160
But I can't rest easy unless there's
something to hold my bangs down.

00:10:05.160 --> 00:10:09.080
Can't I make a headband
from the pillow remnants?

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.840
"Quest"
"Soft Headband"

00:10:12.990 --> 00:10:16.790
But there's no point unless it's cute.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:20.580
I need a tool for more detailed work.

00:10:20.580 --> 00:10:23.490
Princess, your meal!

00:10:23.490 --> 00:10:26.370
Oh, my, you're awake today?

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:29.730
"Scissors Sorcerer"

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.990
I believe this is our first meeting
since you're always asleep.

00:10:29.990 --> 00:10:31.040
Nice to meet you.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.450
Scissors!

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.950
Sorry I was a tad late.

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:40.160
Scissors... scissors...

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.790
You must be hungry.

00:10:36.790 --> 00:10:40.160
My scissor fastener was acting up--Oops!

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:46.700
Goodness! It's broken at last.
I'll need something else to fasten them.

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:50.660
Why, your crown? For me? You're sure?

00:10:50.660 --> 00:10:53.200
In exchange for a pair of your scissors.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:56.950
You don't say! Of course.
Take as many as you need!

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:03.700
Behold! My crown headband!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:11.040
"Quest Complete"

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.040
"Very cute!"

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:11.040
Very cute!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:17.160
I almost forgot. I haven't solved
my bed sheet issue yet.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:21.540
Besides, what am I to do with
these overlarge scissors I got?

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.910
"Quest"
"Luxury Sheets"

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.430
Red Siberians

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:44.540
Hm?

00:11:44.540 --> 00:11:48.910
Bad news! The princess is hunting
for cloaks near the clock tower

00:11:48.910 --> 00:11:50.620
using a giant pair of scissors!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:52.580
What?! Severe punishment will--

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:55.240
Princess!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.700
Not this.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:13.120
Where? Where is the silky cloak I saw earlier?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:15.910
No cloak will be left uncut!

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.160
Great, that was an easy transport job.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:25.300
"Scaly Reindeer"

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.740
Thanks, Ghost Shroud!

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:25.300
"Ghost Shroud"

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.160
No problem!

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.540
Yeah!

00:12:25.540 --> 00:12:29.540
I-I can't believe it. The cloth itself is alive.

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.080
But I have no need for the head and arms.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.950
Ghost Shroud!

00:12:42.370 --> 00:12:45.330
I've obtained a sheet to sleep on!

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:52.990
"Quest Complete"

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.990
"Excellent work!"

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:52.990
Excellent work!

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:56.370
But I can't simply start sleeping on it.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:59.830
A new sheet requires certain etiquette,

00:12:59.830 --> 00:13:03.120
especially since I took
great pains to acquire it.

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:05.290
I cannot start without doing this first.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:09.450
Dive into a sea of sheets!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:15.080
Amazing. A lovely fragrance.

00:13:15.080 --> 00:13:18.580
Plus, its spiritual aura moisturizes my skin.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.290
What wonderful living cloth.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:24.410
It's sucking me in.

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:28.490
What?! The princess has escaped again?!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:30.790
I will surely talk to her today!

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.080
Zzz...

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.580
Make that tomorrow, after all?

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.970
"Quilladillo"
"A big softie"
"Nice Guy: ☆☆☆☆☆"
"Defense: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.990
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:53.330
In the times when swords and magic
were the authority of the world,

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:57.830
the threat of magical beasts
greatly troubled humans.

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:02.120
And the heroes, who set out
to rescue the princess,

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:05.870
engaged in countless seesaw
battles against them.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:08.580
Hero, another new species?

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:13.160
Yes, we had repeated encounters
with demons near the Wind Fortress.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.580
It must be troubling.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.240
No, it is a trivial matter...

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:23.370
...compared to the troubles of our captured
princess in the Demon Castle!

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.200
The distress...

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:38.160
The recent increase in snoring demons
irritates and distresses me.

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:42.450
How could this be?
Though I remade my pillow and sheets...

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.330
Is this land unfit for my peaceful slumber?

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:46.910
"Demon Castle"

00:14:55.200 --> 00:15:00.200
No, I'm determined to find a new,
more comfortable place to sleep in!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:04.040
"Quest"
"Comfortable Bed"

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.870
This place is huge. I'm lost.

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:12.910
Curse this Demon Castle.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.740
Hey, I heard the princess ran off again.

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:19.330
Why's it normal for her
to have access to the key?

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:20.990
Where am I?

00:15:22.330 --> 00:15:23.950
Noble armory?

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:27.950
There's bound to be a
comfortable bed for me here!

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.290
What's with this shield?

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:34.910
"Turbulently gusting wind"

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:39.040
This Demon Castle has bad taste in noble armor, too?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.040
"Not interested"

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:48.990
It's the shield! The wind is cushioning me?!

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.200
I've discovered a comfortable bed!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:56.830
But I can't carry the whole thing to my room.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:00.160
I need to remove just the wind source.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:03.540
If only I had a suitably sized tool...

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.040
Whoa! Princess?!

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:07.490
Whaddya doin' here, dammit?!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.020
"Baddie Diamond"

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:08.660
A rock.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:12.410
Ooh, ya messed with the treasure, huh?

00:16:12.410 --> 00:16:15.290
Wh-What's that look in yer eyes, dammit?

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:17.490
Why're you spreading that cloth open--

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:20.660
H-Hey, wait! Answer me!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:28.790
Did you know that a hard object
wrapped in cloth and swung around

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:31.830
is a weapon called a blackjack?

00:16:31.830 --> 00:16:33.950
I couldn't care less!

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:38.330
Demon King! Updates on the hero's whereabouts?

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:42.450
Yeah, his force has advanced
to the vicinity of the Wind Fortress.

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:43.830
Hero?

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:46.830
My nation's hero is on his way?

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:49.200
The hero...

00:16:49.200 --> 00:16:53.910
Oh, yes, I vaguely remember him.
I've forgotten his name.

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:54.950
No matter.

00:16:57.330 --> 00:17:00.740
Speaking of, what's the status of
the noble armor, Shield of Wind?

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.120
Right! It's being stored
under surveillance in a chest!

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.200
We plan to transfer it to the dungeons tomorrow.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.540
That item is of great importance.

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:10.910
As noble armor,
it's fragile despite being a shield.

00:17:10.910 --> 00:17:13.910
And there's no replacing it, as it's one of a kind.

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:13.880
"High-Rank Skeleton Soldier"

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:17.200
By the way, what's that obnoxious clanging?

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:19.740
The smithy is nearby.

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.240
Is that right? Working hard, eh?

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.080
Oh, I broke through.

00:17:24.080 --> 00:17:25.990
Great, I separated it.

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:28.910
Transporting it will be an ordeal, though.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.240
That shield gusts turbulent winds.

00:17:31.240 --> 00:17:34.700
But without it, our battle
equilibrium would collapse.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.450
We'll exterminate the hero's party
at the next dungeon!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.370
It must not be damaged!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.240
Yes!

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:43.040
So don't break it! You'd better not!

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.240
"Fuse?"

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.240
Handle

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.240
Ornament

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:47.240
Old
Pillow

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.240
"Yes"

00:17:48.240 --> 00:17:49.490
"Made a trash bundle!"

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:53.950
That ain't a trash can!

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.420
Guards!

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:57.490
I'm done prepping. I'll go back.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:03.700
I'm sure those turbulently gusting winds
will blow all the racket away.

00:18:12.240 --> 00:18:13.450
Oh! Princess?!

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:16.910
Hey, it's dangerous there!

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:17.490
Huh?

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:18.580
"Glossy Gummy"

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.580
Princess!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.580
"Princess's Gravestone"

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:29.660
--Hey, what are we going to do?!
She went to her eternal slumber!
--Oh, shoot!

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:31.740
Who cares? She wanted to sleep.

00:18:31.740 --> 00:18:35.950
Hell no! Someone call the demon cleric!

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:42.950
Am I... sleeping?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:48.660
I see. I found a new bed.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:54.040
That considered, it's rather--

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:57.410
Princess. How regretful that you died.

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.910
"Demon Cleric"

00:19:00.370 --> 00:19:02.240
Have you awoken?

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:04.870
Yeah... Hm?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:08.290
This is the Demon Church
that lies beneath the Demon Castle.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:11.330
Try not to fall into magma anymore, will you?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.450
Ouch!

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:15.580
Hm? What kind of bed is this?

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.580
Was I sleeping in this?

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:21.660
How crude... not fit in
the slightest for restful sleep.

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:23.790
It's almost like a coffin.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:25.120
It <i>is</i> a coffin.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.450
It wasn't a new discovery after all!

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:31.910
P-Princess?

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:35.910
It would've been far better
to sleep in the racket!

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:37.700
Hm? The racket?

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.040
"Comes with thick lid"

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:47.580
Of course!

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:51.330
If it's crude, then refine it.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:52.580
What do you mean?

00:19:54.540 --> 00:20:00.490
Nothing... You have nicely jagged horns, I see.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.490
Huh?

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:07.700
What?! What are you doing?!

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:10.490
First, sand the rough wood with these horns.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:15.040
Then...

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:16.770
"Died together"

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:18.200
Wax it!

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:19.580
Princess!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:23.580
Stop! It'll die! It'll really die!

00:20:21.040 --> 00:20:23.580
What's going on?

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:27.530
"Rotten Zombies"

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:27.530
"Vampires"

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.490
What's all the noise?

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.950
Why, it's the princess!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:35.160
Finally, lay out my newly-crafted
pillow and sheet.

00:20:35.160 --> 00:20:36.620
What's she doing?

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:37.660
No idea.

00:20:37.660 --> 00:20:38.910
A sorta ritual?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:40.160
What's she doing?

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.240
I have no idea!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:42.330
Go ask!

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:43.370
You ask!

00:20:44.490 --> 00:20:45.870
She crawled in?!

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.370
It's so... quiet!

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:59.200
"Quest Complete"

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.200
"Achieved peace
and quiet"

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:59.200
Achieved peace and quiet.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.790
Heave-ho.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:02.580
Carry her to her room for now.

00:21:04.620 --> 00:21:08.700
Yes, I found it. This is a place of good rest.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:12.410
And the fragrance of freshly
sanded wood is superb.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:15.620
An utter sense of peace.

00:21:17.910 --> 00:21:19.660
Sleeping again today?

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:20.910
Yes...

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.410
Sleeping with vulgar bedding again.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:25.080
I hope to have it returned.

00:21:26.910 --> 00:21:30.040
You try the demon king's patience!
Today, I'm determined to talk--

00:21:38.990 --> 00:21:41.660
Make that tomorrow, after all?

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:44.040
The princess is a hostage, right?

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:45.200
'Course she is!

00:21:45.200 --> 00:21:46.410
Keep it down!

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:47.360
My bad.

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:47.870
No, sorry.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:53.740
Did I choose the wrong princess to abduct?

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.040
Huh?

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.660
Think about it.

00:21:56.660 --> 00:22:01.490
You think an abducted princess should be
peacefully asleep in the Demon Castle?!

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:02.580
Zzz...

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:38.600
"Hero's party afterwards"

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:38.830
What in the world?

00:23:38.830 --> 00:23:40.540
Huh? What's that?

00:23:42.870 --> 00:23:47.740
They say that you sleep soundly if you're
productive during the day.

00:23:47.740 --> 00:23:51.660
It's true, I think I can sleep well tonight.

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:54.660
Next time, "The Princess and Furious Fluff."

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:56.450
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
